v><div id="i9b15c2d02f2141e2880c0e072ba40f9a_145"></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span style="color:#1207c9;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%;text-decoration:underline">Item 5.</span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">  </span><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c-13" name="ecd:MtrlTermsOfTrdArrTextBlock" id="f-2482" continuedAt="f-2482-1" escape="true"><span style="color:#1207c9;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">OTHER INFORMATION</span></ix:nonNumeric></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span><br/></span></div><ix:continuation id="f-2482-1"><div><span style="color:#1207c9;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Item 5(a)</span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span><br/></span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">None.</span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span><br/></span></div><div><span style="color:#1207c9;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Item 5(b)</span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span><br/></span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">None.</span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span><br/></span></div><div><span style="color:#1207c9;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Item 5(c)</span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span><br/></span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">During the three months ended June&#160;30, 2026, <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c-13" name="ecd:Rule10b51ArrAdoptedFlag" format="ixt:fixed-false" id="f-2483"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c-13" name="ecd:NonRule10b51ArrTrmntdFlag" format="ixt:fixed-false" id="f-2484"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c-13" name="ecd:NonRule10b51ArrAdoptedFlag" format="ixt:fixed-false" id="f-2485"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c-13" name="ecd:Rule10b51ArrTrmntdFlag" format="ixt:fixed-false" id="f-2486">none</ix:nonNumeric></ix:nonNumeric></ix:nonNumeric></ix:nonNumeric> of the Company&#8217;s directors or executive officers adopted or terminated any contract, instruction or written plan for the purchase or sale of Citizens, Inc. securities that was intended to satisfy the affirmative defense conditions of Rule 10b5-1(c) or any &#8220;non-Rule 10b5-1 trading arrangement.&#8221;  Additionally, Citizens did not adopt or terminate any Rule 10b5-1 trading arrangement during the three months ended June&#160;30, 2026.</span></div></ix:continuation><div style="margin-bottom:3pt;text-align:center"><span><br/></span></div><div style="height:72pt;position:relative;width:100%"><div style="bottom:0;position:absolute;width:100%"><div style="text-align:right"><span><br/></span></div><div style="text-align:right"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">June&#160;30, 2026     |    10-Q            61</span></div><div style="text-align:right"><span><br/></span></div></div></div><div id="i9b15c2d02f2141e2880c0e072ba40f9a_148"></div><hr style="page-break-after:always"/><div style="min-height:72pt;width:100%"><div style="-sec-extract:summary;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#0000ff;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;text-decoration:underline"><a style="-sec-extract:exhibit;color:#0000ff;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;text-decoration:underline" href="#i9b15c2d02f2141e2880c0e072ba40f9a_7">Table of Contents</a></span><span style="color:#0000ff;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-s